                       Cardgames

Various card games; up til now they consist of:

  - Røvhult (the danish words for arsehole); a game I learned from 3 danes
    while travelling South America. 


Planned are:

  - TwoPart: A game I learned from some norwegians. They probably mentioned the
    name; though I was not able to remember it (you have no idea how long it
    took me to learn the word "røvhult" - not to mention the pronuncation).
    So the name descirbes the game (a bit).

  - Burazno: A famous game in Venezuela; a bit similar to Canasta or the like
    in Europe.

  - Tarok. The game of my youth (long ago). Fucking hell, looking forward to
    the computer player.


