How to report bugs and/or send patches
--------------------------------------

Bug reports and patches should be send to the e-mail address of the author (me)
(g17m0@lycos.com).

Please include

  - The version of the package. In case you don't know: The title of the
    about box.
  - How to reproduce the bug.
  - In case of a crash there should also be a stackdump in your systemlog which
    might help in localizing the bug.
  - Anything else you think might be helpful.

Please note that I don't (can't) check my mails daily, so please be patient.
